printer-driver-nelko (0.3.7) unstable; urgency=low

  * Remember last-seen P21-class BlueZ names so Get-Devices / KDE Add
    Printer still lists the printer when it is off.
  * nelko-setup-printer sets Description and printer-error-policy
    retry-job so the CUPS queue stays in KDE System Settings → Printers
    and holds jobs until the printer is back.

 -- remote_codes pack <remote-codes@example.com>  Wed, 29 Oct 2026 07:50:00 -0700

